eight: bold;\">▶ 통합정보시스템&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">–&nbsp;학생서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">-수업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">-학생</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">시간표 조회 하단 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">교과목 현황-조회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전자출결에서 출결상황이 미입력된 과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">미출결 상태</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">은 출석미달교과목 현황에서 조회되지 않아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">대상자에서 누락될 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">전자출결 앱에서 본인의 출결상황을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- LMS&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">동영상 강의 및 실시간 온라인 강의의 출결정보는 반영시기가 유동적일 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 이에 따라 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">대상이 아님에도 안내메세지가 발송될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">-<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><b> <b>조기취업자 출석인정승인자의 경우&nbsp;최종승인 전까지는 실제출결석 여부에 따라 출결상태가 입력되니 대상에 포함되어&nbsp;메세지를 수신할 수 있습니다.</b></b></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><b>&nbsp; <b>최종승인이 완료되면 일괄출석 처리 되니 메세지를 수신하였을 경우&nbsp;조기취업자출석인정 선승인여부를 우선 확인바랍니다.</b></b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 출석미달 (주의) 과목이 여러개일 경우 메세지를 중복수신 할 수 있습니다.</span></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">출결에 오류가 있을 시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">해당과목 교수님에게 문의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">기타문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">교무과&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">478-7031</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
